      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MediaForge Video Batch: MiniMax H3\n\nRedraws a long video through MiniMax H3 a batch at a time. Each batch is its own 5 seconds: H3 doesn't see the batches around it, so motion can jump between them.\n\n1. Pick your H3 models in the loaders: UNet, optional turbo LoRA, text encoder, video VAE, audio VAE.\n2. Pick a video on **Start Video Batch** and write your prompt. `<Video 1>` is this batch.\n3. Press Run.\n\nH3 needs `frames_per_batch` to be 17n+5 (124 is about 5 s) and `fps` to be 24. Other batch sizes are refused before the model runs."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
